  "id": "chicken-and-chorizo-jambalaya",
  "name": "Chicken and Chorizo Jambalaya",
  "subtitle": "A hearty one-pot rice dish with chicken, chorizo, and peppers",
  "description": "Chicken, chorizo, vegetables, tomatoes, and rice simmer together in a seasoned stock for a flavorful, filling meal.",
